# Linguistic configuration
#
# This section helps GIT to identify languages associated to files and then allow Github, Gitlab or Bitbucket to 
# correctly display languages statistics.
#
# For additional documentation see the following pages.
#  - https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/repository/#add-repository-languages
#  - https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md
#  - https://github.com/github/linguist/blob/main/lib/linguist/languages.yml
docs/*          linguist-documentation

Dockerfile      linguist-language=Dockerfile
Makefile        linguist-language=Makefile
Vagrantfile     linguist-language=Ruby
*.adoc          linguist-language=AsciiDoc
*.c             linguist-language=C
*.css           linguist-language=CSS
